		<name>Credo scrounging</name>
		<adjective>scavenging</adjective>
		<memberName>Scavenger</memberName>
		<leaderTitleMale>Scavenger superior(a)</leaderTitleMale>
		<leaderTitleFemale>Scavenger superior(a)</leaderTitleFemale>
		<description>"The wilderness around our settlement was devoid of natural resources, but we were confident in the knowledge that water is the essence of all life, both a physical and spiritual source of renewal. Perhaps ancient technology is junk, or perhaps it is the key to our survival."</description>
		<descriptionTemplate>"The wilderness around our settlement was devoid of natural resources, but we were confident in the knowledge that water is the essence of all life, both a physical and spiritual source of renewal. Perhaps ancient technology is junk, or perhaps it is the key to our survival."</descriptionTemplate>
		<culture>Astropolitan</culture>
		<iconDef>Skull</iconDef>
		<colorDef>LightSapphire</colorDef>
		<memes>
